1 NOTE Name and birth/death YEARS (1929-2016) per G-26 (Ronald Ray Schmidt's own Find a Grave memorial, Family Members panel, directly viewed 2 Oct 2026) -- no day/month given there
2 CONT The raw GEDCOM import carries day-level birth (18 Sep 1929, Chicago, Cook Co., Illinois) and death (19 Oct 2016, Cecil, Washington Co., Pennsylvania) across an Ancestry index record and the 1930 census, plus a funeral-home obituary link that is now dead (redirects to the funeral home's current obituary listing as of 2 Oct 2026) -- none of these three citations has been viewed at an image by this project, so none is asserted here; see open_lead 648
2 CONT No marriage date to Ronald has been found in any source (the raw GEDCOM's own FAM record for them, F213, carries HUSB/WIFE/CHIL but no MARR tag at all)
2 CONT Checked for a separate Find a Grave memorial of her own, as Marylyn Seitzberg turned out to have (delta a1758) -- none found; Ronald's own memorial does not link her name to a memorial page of its own, and a direct Find a Grave search (Joan Schmidt, died 2016, Pennsylvania) returns one unrelated match only.
1 NOTE SCHMIDTISTICS source(s): G-26
